# Deploy files run on Linux; a stray CR breaks env parsing and Caddyfile directives.
# Patterns in a .gitattributes are relative to ITS OWN directory, so the previous
# `deploy/stc/**` resolved to deploy/stc/deploy/stc/** and matched nothing —
# `git check-attr eol -- deploy/stc/Caddyfile` reported "unspecified". LF was
# holding only because this workstation happens to set core.autocrlf=true.
* text eol=lf
